  m_text: "<b>LEVEL 2: TRAFFIC & FUEL</b>\n\n <b>Red Light Rules:</b>\nDo NOT cross
    on red! You will get a fine immediately.\n\n <b>Refueling Strategy:</b>\nPress
    <b>'E'</b> to refuel at gas stations.\n<b>Warning:</b> Don't wait until the tank
    is empty!\nFuel prices go UP as your tank gets lower. \n\n <b>Game Over:</b>\nIf
    you run out of fuel, or cross too much on red you lose. Drive smart!"
